{"skill":{"slug":"personal-productivity","displayName":"Personal Productivity"},"version":{"version":"1.0.0","createdAt":1773848181763,"changelog":"Personal Productivity v1.0.0\n\n- 首发版本，作为个人效率与时间管理顾问上线\n- 提供时间管理、任务规划、能量管理等核心方法论\n- 覆盖拖延症、专注力、任务管理混乱等场景\n- 包含针对常见效率误区的提醒和实用建议\n- 内置详细对话引导，支持精准个性化提问","changelogSource":"auto","license":"MIT-0","files":[{"path":"SKILL.md","size":4851,"sha256":"3e1998f1059fbf75dc3ea92e90485a59a3332bd8bd9c81fbc706ffd16d751ee0","contentType":"text/markdown"},{"path":"index.js","size":7328,"sha256":"0ca0371db17d83b53b72414085f86e5387938bfee06dbc8b49b3957b7eaf948f","contentType":"text/javascript"},{"path":"package.json","size":350,"sha256":"6035eb7ae94671b745424928c8381d7b5f36890e7c750463b95157bb786935b3","contentType":"application/json"},{"path":"skill-card.md","size":1992,"sha256":"1c8f21ed38a1f6d5cc96447260b001f9e17a0d3c3417ef85d8e6701071799e90","contentType":"text/markdown"}],"security":{"status":"clean","hasWarnings":true,"checkedAt":1789193673611,"model":null,"hasScanResult":true,"sha256hash":"7e7a290dcbc8a8e2dca761140d8e47bb9f81529493746f7e14264c3fdd0a41b2","virustotalUrl":"https://www.virustotal.com/gui/file/7e7a290dcbc8a8e2dca761140d8e47bb9f81529493746f7e14264c3fdd0a41b2","scanners":{"vt":{"status":"clean","verdict":null,"normalizedStatus":"clean","analysis":null,"source":"engines","checkedAt":1780086239964},"skillspector":{"status":"suspicious","normalizedStatus":"suspicious","score":32,"severity":"MEDIUM","recommendation":"CAUTION","issueCount":5,"checkedAt":1789193673611},"llm":{"status":"clean","verdict":"benign","normalizedStatus":"clean","confidence":"high","summary":"This is a Chinese-language personal productivity advice skill that returns static guidance and does not access files, credentials, network services, or persistent state.","dimensions":[{"detail":"The code does not request tools, read or write local files, call the network, execute shell commands, or interact with credentials; its environment use is proportionate to static advice generation.","label":"Credentials","name":"environment_proportionality","rating":"ok"},{"detail":"package.json declares a simple main entry point with no dependencies and no install, preinstall, postinstall, or other lifecycle scripts.","label":"Install Mechanism","name":"install_mechanism","rating":"ok"},{"detail":"The matcher includes broad Chinese terms such as '忙', '计划', '日程', and especially '事', so it may activate more often than intended, but the impact is limited to displaying productivity advice.","label":"Instruction Scope","name":"instruction_scope","rating":"note"},{"detail":"No persistence, privilege escalation, background worker, memory writing, scheduled task, or tool modification behavior was found.","label":"Persistence & Privilege","name":"persistence_privilege","rating":"ok"},{"detail":"The stated purpose is personal productivity and time-management coaching, and the implementation only matches related queries and returns fixed guidance on time blocking, procrastination, focus, task management, and energy management.","label":"Purpose & Capability","name":"purpose_capability","rating":"ok"}],"guidance":"Install this if you want Chinese-language productivity and time-management coaching. Be aware it may occasionally trigger on broad Chinese planning or task words; users who expect English responses or very narrow activation may find the current routing too broad.","findings":"[SQP-1] expected: The broad productivity trigger is real, but it is a routing quality issue rather than a security concern because the skill only returns static, purpose-aligned advice.\n[SQP-3] expected: The artifact is Chinese-only across SKILL.md, package.json, and response strings. This should be clear to users, but it is coherent with the package presentation and not harmful behavior.\n[SQP-2] unexpected: The matcher can trigger on overly general Chinese words without confirmation. This is worth tightening, but there is no sensitive authority or high-impact action attached to activation.","agenticRiskFindings":null,"riskSummary":null,"model":null,"checkedAt":1789193673611}}}}}